{{!-- Wound/lives track (Жизни) — shared by the Character and NPC sheets, rendered
     standalone by #patchWoundTrack() (actor-sheet.mjs/npc-sheet.mjs) so a lose/restore
     click can patch just this block instead of re-rendering the whole sheet.

     Numeric counter, no text label (2026-08-24 — mirrors GRIT's own redesign; the heart
     icon alone stands in for the old "Жизни" caption, see its own data-tooltip below).
     LMB on the whole-value takes one wound, RMB restores one — no "burn"/permanent-max
     concept here, unlike GRIT's max field (per user: "сжигания сердец у меня нет"), so
     the max stays a plain number, only adjustable via the edit-mode "+"/"-" below. See
     #onWoundLoseClick/#onWoundRestoreClick in actor-sheet.mjs/npc-sheet.mjs.

     Guard stays hasTrack-only (unlike grit-track.hbs's own edit-mode guard) — hasTrack
     is false only when there's no species (Race/Creature) item attached at all, and the
     "+"/"-" below raise/lower that item's OWN woundSteps field, so without one there's
     nothing for them to act on regardless of edit mode. "-" clamps at 1 (that field's own
     schema min, items.mjs) — a species always has at least one life. --}}
{{#if woundTrack.hasTrack}}
<div class="wound-track">
  <div class="wound-counter-row">
    <i class="life-icon-badge" data-tooltip="Жизни" data-tooltip-direction="UP"></i>
    <span class="wound-counter-value" data-tooltip="ЛКМ — потерять жизнь, ПКМ — восстановить" data-tooltip-direction="UP">{{woundTrack.current}}</span>
    <span class="wound-counter-sep">/</span>
    <span class="wound-counter-max">{{woundTrack.max}}</span>
    {{#if woundTrack.badgeLabel}}<span class="wound-track-state">{{woundTrack.badgeLabel}}</span>{{/if}}
    {{#if editMode}}
    <button type="button" class="wound-max-sub" title="Уменьшить максимум Жизней на 1">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-minus"></i>
    </button>
    <button type="button" class="wound-max-add" title="Увеличить максимум Жизней на 1">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i>
    </button>
    {{/if}}
  </div>
</div>
{{/if}}
